# Data Science Co-Working — frontend environment
#
# This is a static Vite site. It currently needs NO environment variables.
#
# If one is added later:
#   - Only variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to the app (import.meta.env.VITE_*).
#   - They are embedded in public JavaScript at build time — anyone can read them.
#   - NEVER put database URLs, passwords, API secrets or private tokens here.
#     Those belong on a backend, not in a static site.
#
# Example (public values only):
# VITE_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://example.com
